cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Satellite Data Search Toolkit"
abstract: >
  An end-to-end toolkit for finding, reviewing, and downloading satellite
  imagery (Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, Landsat 8/9, NISAR, MODIS, Sentinel-6)
  over an area of interest, plus tools for forecasting future satellite
  overpasses to plan field data collection.
